name: Erratic Ten Spike — many 10s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Tens, a 25% rank spike for Walkie Talkie,
  Even Steven, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic tens, many 10s, ten of spades
  style seed, screenshot rank pile, funny repeated tens.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Ten
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: WalkieTalkie
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
  - joker: EvenSteven
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Three of a Kind payoff from Ten density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Ten density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
